translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:533
    old "Tell me how you want me. I... I'm still learning to ask that."
    new "Dime cómo me quieres. Yo... todavía estoy aprendiendo a pedir eso."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:533
    old "Set the pace. Please. It's easier when you decide."
    new "Marca tú el ritmo. Por favor. Es más fácil cuando tú decides."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:538
    old "However you want me. Just say it."
    new "Como me quieras. Solo dilo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:538
    old "Give me the pace. I'll keep it."
    new "Dame el ritmo. Yo lo mantengo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:543
    old "Faster"
    new "Más rápido"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:546
    old "Yes... like this."
    new "Sí... así."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:549
    old "Slower"
    new "Más despacio"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:552
    old "Slow... okay. I can do slow."
    new "Despacio... está bien. Despacio puedo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:555
    old "Keep going like this"
    new "Sigue así"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:556
    old "Like this, then. Tell me if that changes."
    new "Así, entonces. Avísame si eso cambia."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:565
    old "We could... switch. To how YOU like it. If you want."
    new "Podríamos... cambiar. A como te gusta a TI. Si quieres."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:567
    old "Put me how you like me best. Go on."
    new "Ponme como más te guste. Anda."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:569
    old "Switch"
    new "Cambiemos"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:576
    old "Stay like this"
    new "Quédate así"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:577
    old "Then I'm not moving. Your call."
    new "Entonces no me muevo. Tú decides."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:584
    old "When it's time... where do you want to finish? I'd rather know. And accept it."
    new "Cuando llegue el momento... ¿dónde quieres acabar? Prefiero saberlo. Y aceptarlo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:586
    old "Where am I taking it this time? Your choice. It always is."
    new "¿Dónde lo voy a recibir esta vez? La decisión es tuya. Siempre lo es."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:588
    old "Where I decide, when I decide"
    new "Donde yo decida, cuando yo decida"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:590
    old "...Understood. I'll be ready."
    new "...Entendido. Estaré lista."

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:593
    old "You'll find out"
    new "Ya lo descubrirás"

    # game/scripts/Actions/femdom.rpy:595
    old "That answer shouldn't work on me. It does."
    new "Esa respuesta no debería funcionar conmigo. Pero funciona."

